  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Aligns LibreWinForms 0.1.0-preview.41 with immutable LibreWPF 0.1.0-preview.41 and ProGPU 0.1.0-preview.47; builds unchanged .NET WinForms templates through LibreWinForms.Sdk with Application startup compatibility and ProGPU-backed System.Drawing cardinal curves; validates hosted drawing contexts through the typed ProGpuDrawingContextState conversion, rejects invalid native contexts and non-finite transforms, and preserves immutable outer/client transform composition without reflection; consumes ProGPU's compact retained picture commands, glyph/scalar/layer records, specialized single-run text blobs, and reusable nonblocking image readback without a downstream compatibility path; validates native popup-local Cocoa input through the same typed coordinate conversion used by production hosts; bounds retained formatted-text and text drawing-group caches to reduce the measured churn working set by 81.3% and residual retention by 60.7% without increasing steady-frame allocations; reuses retained designer adorners and guards render-cache growth under repeated design-surface interaction; persists versioned, bounded designer SerializationStore payloads and content component collections across save/load cycles; preserves Project Explorer and designer double-click counts; keeps MenuStrip, ToolStrip, context menus, and dropdowns correctly positioned and interactive; and retains typed X11/XWayland positioning, movement, dispatcher-pump, text, image, and scene-performance behavior.",
